    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Objective\n\nYour goal is to gather all the items on your Grocery List
    as fast as possible.\nNavigate the aisles, find the groceries, and avoid any
    obstacles or hazards.\n\nUI Elements\nPanic Meter: Watch your panic meter! If
    it fills up, you lose control for a short time.\nGrocery List: Displays the items
    you need to collect.\nCircular Dash Meter: Shows your dash cooldown. When the
    meter is full, you can dash again.\n\n Grocery Placement\n\nItems are placed
    randomly across the grocery store. Explore different aisles to find them.\nSome
    items might be behind shelves or require interacting with NPCs to obtain.\n\nEnemies\n\nNPCs:
    Avoid certain NPCs who may block your path. Some might move along set paths,
    so time your moves carefully.\nTraps/Hazards: Look out for spilled liquids or
    other hazards that could slow you down.\n\nWinning\n\nOnce you've collected all
    the items on your grocery list, make your way to the checkout counter to complete
    the level.\nFinish in the shortest time possible to earn higher scores!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b24b97e00dfc4049b972bed232d626d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 5212190068505998125, guid: 8b24b97e00dfc4049b972bed232d626d, type: 2}
